## solution

```js
const isPrime = (n) => {
  if (n < 2) return false;

  for (let i = 2; i <= Math.sqrt(n); i += 1) {
    if (n % i === 0) return false;
  }

  return true;
};
```

- n = input number
- Time: O(square_root(n))
- Space: O(1)

